# Generated Verilator build trees (each level's Makefile `clean` removes these).
# `build_*` = per-CPU dirs (neg1/level_0); `build` = level_1's single build dir:
level_*/build_*/
level_*/build/
level_*/obj_dir/

# Regeneratable run artifacts (recreated by building/running a level):
# build/run logs, ce-by-ce/PC/boot traces, VCD waveforms, PBM screens,
# and the level_1 out/ dir. Never needed in git.
level_*/out/
level_*/*.log
level_*/*.txt
level_*/*.vcd
level_*/*.pbm
